What is the rule of law, and how does it support a fair society?
:::

:::oak-task {id="task-a"}

:::oak-heading {id="task-a-heading" level="2"}
Task A: What is the rule of law?
:::

:::oak-question {id="question-1"}
In a paragraph, explain what the rule of law is using the following words:

:::oak-table {id="rule-of-law-words" role="key-words" header="false"}
fair / fairly | equality | accountability
consistent | government | judicial review
:::

